    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent a stored cross-origin iframe bypass of the allowed_iframes prefix policy. The post sanitizer now requires the stored iframe src and its decoded form to both match an allowlisted prefix, blocking encoded userinfo that would let a browser load an attacker-controlled host.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
